{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.poster.avif?t=1756435109\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.webm?t=1756435109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/c8bb435bcacd099e8e06adee0c5b49d9.mp4?t=1756435109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dave. What ties him to RDS?<br>Maybe this facility is more than just a place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He woke up, believing the nightmare was over?<br>What if awakening was only the beginning\u2026 the beginning of the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He went there to make sure it was just a figment of his imagination?<br>Maybe this place was truly born\u2026 from the greed and malice of those who knew no limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He only wanted to take a look?<br>But what if RDS is a cancer that can never be removed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s looking for a way out?<br>Do you feel that every step only drags him deeper\u2026 just so RDS can consume him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! Wait for me. Before it\u2019s too late...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.poster.avif?t=1756435109\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960010/extras/84d78d0529589295fd938babcf44dbbc.webm?t=1756435109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as